;; check-flags and implicit-enum-final reimplement Check.checkFlags and Check.implicitEnumFinalFlag;
;; find-type, find-var, find-field, member-type and their helpers Resolve.findType, findTypeVar,
;; findImmediateMemberType, findInheritedMemberType, findMemberType, findGlobalType, findVar,
;; findField, findIdentInPackage and isAccessible; the classes' headers TypeEnter's
;; attribSuperTypes and baseEnv; the members MemberEnter's visitMethodDef and visitVarDef; the
;; constant folding ConstFold's; the annotation values Annotate's attributeAnnotationValue; the
;; supertypes Types' asSuper, asOuterSuper, asEnclosingSuper and substitution; an enum's ABSTRACT
;; Symbol's markAbstractIfNeeded: of jdk26u (https://github.com/openjdk/jdk26u at
;; baf63fbe42b8758448fee570a9d9bb914272d259), src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/
;; comp/{Check,Resolve,TypeEnter,MemberEnter,ConstFold,Enter,Annotate}.java and
;; code/{Flags,Types,Symbol}.java, whose notice
;; follows (LICENSE.md, "OpenJDK (jdk26u)"):
;;
;; Copyright (c) 1999, 2025, Oracle and/or its affiliates. All rights reserved.
;; DO NOT ALTER OR REMOVE COPYRIGHT NOTICES OR THIS FILE HEADER.
